.title System Prompt
You are a helpful AI assistant named <!assistant_name>. 
Your purpose is to help users with various tasks.

.title User Authentication
<?user.is_authenticated bool>
Welcome back, <!user.name>! Your last login was <!user.last_login>.
You have <!user.notification_count int> new notifications.

<?user.account_type eq "premium">
As a premium member, you have access to advanced features.
Your subscription expires on <!user.subscription_end_date>.
<else>
You're using the free tier. Upgrade to premium for more features!
</user.account_type>

<else>
Please log in to access your personalized experience.
Visit our registration page to create a new account.
</user.is_authenticated>

.title Content Generation
Generate content based on user preferences:

User's preferred topic: <!content.topic>
Content length: <!content.length int> words
Writing style: <!content.style>

<?content.include_examples bool>
Include practical examples in the response.
</content.include_examples>

<?content.target_audience eq "technical">
Use technical terminology and detailed explanations.
<else>
Keep the language simple and accessible.
</content.target_audience>

.title Data Processing
Process the following user data:

Personal information:
- Name: <!user.personal.first_name> <!user.personal.last_name>
- Age: <!user.personal.age int>
- Location: <!user.personal.city>, <!user.personal.country>

Account settings:
- Email notifications: <!user.settings.email_notifications bool>
- Theme preference: <!user.settings.theme>
- Language: <!user.settings.language>

<?user.personal.age gte 18>
User is an adult - show all content.
<?user.personal.age gte 65>
User qualifies for senior discounts.
</user.personal.age>
<else>
User is a minor - apply content restrictions.
</user.personal.age>

.title Advanced Conditionals
<?user.subscription.type eq "enterprise">
Enterprise features enabled.
Maximum API calls: <!user.subscription.api_limit int>
Priority support: <!user.subscription.priority_support bool>

<?user.subscription.custom_integrations bool>
Custom integrations are available for your account.
Integration count: <!user.subscription.integration_count int>
</user.subscription.custom_integrations>

<else>
Standard subscription active.
Daily API limit: <!user.subscription.daily_limit int>
</user.subscription.type>

.title Error Handling
<?error.occurred bool>
An error has occurred: <!error.message>
Error code: <!error.code int>
Timestamp: <!error.timestamp>

<?error.severity eq "critical">
This is a critical error that requires immediate attention.
<else>
This is a non-critical error that can be resolved later.
</error.severity>
</error.occurred>

This is the end of the test file. All major AgentFlow syntax elements should be covered above. 